{"is_source_file": true, "format": "C++ header file", "description": "This file defines the SystemDelegate class, which manages system-related operations and event handling for a media device platform. It provides methods to retrieve and set device information (like make, name, SKU, firmware version, country code), get screen and video resolutions, HDCP and HDR status, and handle audio formats. It also manages subscriptions to lower-level Thunder plugin events related to display settings, HDCP, and system info, and emits corresponding high-level events to the application. The class interacts with external Thunder RPC calls and manages internal event dispatching and notification handling.", "external_files": ["<plugins/plugins.h>", "<core/JSON.h>", "UtilsLogging.h", "UtilsJsonrpcDirectLink.h", "UtilsController.h", "BaseEventDelegate.h"], "external_methods": ["WPEFramework::Utils::GetThunderControllerClient", "LOGINFO", "LOGERR", "LOGDBG"], "published": ["GetDeviceMake", "GetDeviceName", "SetDeviceName", "GetDeviceSku", "GetFirmwareVersion", "GetCountryCode", "SetCountryCode", "GetTimeZone", "SetTimeZone", "GetSecondScreenFriendlyName", "GetScreenResolution", "GetVideoResolution", "GetHdcp", "GetHdr", "GetAudio", "EmitOnVideoResolutionChanged", "EmitOnScreenResolutionChanged", "EmitOnHdcpChanged", "EmitOnHdrChanged", "EmitOnNameChanged", "EmitOnAudioChanged", "HandleEvent"], "classes": [{"name": "SystemDelegate", "description": "A class that manages system information retrieval, event subscriptions, and event emissions related to device configuration, display, HDCP, HDR, and audio settings, facilitating communication between Thunder plugins and the application layer."}], "methods": [{"name": "Core::hresult GetDeviceMake(std::string & make)", "description": "Retrieves the device manufacturer name by invoking 'getDeviceInfo' on the System plugin.", "scope": "SystemDelegate", "scopeKind": "class"}, {"name": "Core::hresult GetDeviceName(std::string & name)", "description"